# The set team raised for the rematches (docs/decisions.md "Set team raised for the rematches"):
# Empoleon (L87) as CP23 left it, Garchomp, Luxray and Staraptor to 85 with their League moves (Fire Fang over Cut for
# Garchomp), Bibarel (the HM user) last as before. At 80, Cynthia's rematch (74-78) was lost on seed 3.
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 85 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW platinum:MOVE_CRUNCH platinum:MOVE_FIRE_FANG
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_LUXRAY 85 platinum:MOVE_THUNDER_FANG platinum:MOVE_CRUNCH platinum:MOVE_ICE_FANG platinum:MOVE_FIRE_FANG
party 3 platinum:SPECIES_STARAPTOR 85 platinum:MOVE_BRAVE_BIRD platinum:MOVE_CLOSE_COMBAT platinum:MOVE_AERIAL_ACE platinum:MOVE_QUICK_ATTACK
